WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.793
The three quarters exponent.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.684
A walk that never crosses itself should

3
00:00:04.684 --> 00:00:06.569
spread like n to the three quarters.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.488
Exponents for strips and cylinders transfer, by renewal, to fixed-length walks.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.433
Claimed: three quarters, on the honeycomb lattice only.

6
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.015
Lean covers part.
